(734257, 78119, 19708, '<td valign="top">Stunning image! The detail in the eye is exceptional, and the surrounding area desaturation was ideal for this shot.</td>', 'Stunning image! The detail in the eye is exceptional, and the surrounding area desaturation was ideal for this shot.', '2004-05-24 20:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(734258, 78808, 19708, '<td valign="top">Good eye!<br/>The perspective on this is well done, as are the reflections.</td>', 'Good eye!The perspective on this is well done, as are the reflections.', '2004-05-24 20:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(734261, 78785, 19708, '<td valign="top">What a great image.<br/>The detail in the cat''sface is very clear, and the "mouse hole" is out of focus enough to give depth to the shot.<br/></td>', 'What a great image.The detail in the cat''sface is very clear, and the "mouse hole" is out of focus enough to give depth to the shot.', '2004-05-24 20:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(734263, 78451, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and detail here.<br/>The blue reflective surfaces really draw the eye into the center.</td>', 'Great lighting and detail here.The blue reflective surfaces really draw the eye into the center.', '2004-05-24 20:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(734264, 78374, 19708, '<td valign="top">Very good composition here.<br/>The contrast of the heavy blue in the sky really sets this one.</td>', 'Very good composition here.The contrast of the heavy blue in the sky really sets this one.', '2004-05-24 20:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(734269, 78263, 10867, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image, but I don''t see the angle as particularly unusual, I''m afraid.</td>', 'This is a lovely image, but I don''t see the angle as particularly unusual, I''m afraid.', '2004-05-24 20:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(734270, 78374, 10867, '<td valign="top">Great graphics and colours!</td>', 'Great graphics and colours!', '2004-05-24 20:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(734272, 78667, 10867, '<td valign="top">Yes, this certainly is an unusual POV!</td>', 'Yes, this certainly is an unusual POV!', '2004-05-24 20:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(734277, 78677, 16957, '<td valign="top">Rejkjavik? Nicely observed and humorous. I can''t help feeling though that you might have been able to find a better location from which to shoot so as to avoid all that distracting background clutter. Or are the streetlights part of the composition? If so I don''t like them. Those hills in the background would have made a wonderful backdrop. Even if you couldn''t have avoided the clutter, you could have minimised it (move left and have streetlights behind statutes) and then used advanced editing rules to remove what remained. 7</td>', 'Rejkjavik? Nicely observed and humorous. I can''t help feeling though that you might have been able to find a better location from which to shoot so as to avoid all that distracting background clutter. Or are the streetlights part of the composition? If so I don''t like them. Those hills in the background would have made a wonderful backdrop. Even if you couldn''t have avoided the clutter, you could have minimised it (move left and have streetlights behind statutes) and then used advanced editing rules to remove what remained. 7', '2004-05-24 20:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(734280, 78561, 16957, '<td valign="top">Very clever and technically spot on. The focus and clarity of the beer contrasts nicely with the just right amount of fuzziness in the person. Well captured.</td>', 'Very clever and technically spot on. The focus and clarity of the beer contrasts nicely with the just right amount of fuzziness in the person. Well captured.', '2004-05-24 20:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(734281, 77373, 16957, '<td valign="top">Rather uninteresting. It''s not really an unusual viewpoint and there''s little to hold the attention.</td>', 'Rather uninteresting. It''s not really an unusual viewpoint and there''s little to hold the attention.', '2004-05-24 20:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(734283, 78878, 16957, '<td valign="top">Hard to rate this shot as the noise is so extreme due I suppose to a very fast ISO. Credit for capturing the bird in difficult conditions but suffers from poor quality.</td>', 'Hard to rate this shot as the noise is so extreme due I suppose to a very fast ISO. Credit for capturing the bird in difficult conditions but suffers from poor quality.', '2004-05-24 20:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(734284, 78841, 16982, '<td valign="top">Very mysterious and wow, so colourful!</td>', 'Very mysterious and wow, so colourful!', '2004-05-24 20:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(734286, 78304, 16957, '<td valign="top">It was nice weather in Edinburgh at the weekend wasn''t it? A lovely shot with effective use of focal length to provide the right sense of space and freedom. Nice composition with figures and the sky adds greatly to a sense of drama. Only slight quibble is that it not that unusual a viewpoint - hilltops are fairly usual places from which to gaze. However, I''m not being too particular about this as what''s usual to one person is unusual to another. Well done. (challenge you to spot my pic taken in Edinburgh:)))</td>', 'It was nice weather in Edinburgh at the weekend wasn''t it? A lovely shot with effective use of focal length to provide the right sense of space and freedom. Nice composition with figures and the sky adds greatly to a sense of drama. Only slight quibble is that it not that unusual a viewpoint - hilltops are fairly usual places from which to gaze. However, I''m not being too particular about this as what''s usual to one person is unusual to another. Well done. (challenge you to spot my pic taken in Edinburgh:)))', '2004-05-24 20:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(734287, 78877, 16957, '<td valign="top">Good ide abut photo is poorly shot and out of focus. A tricky shot but you need to persist in your attempts.</td>', 'Good ide abut photo is poorly shot and out of focus. A tricky shot but you need to persist in your attempts.', '2004-05-24 20:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(734289, 78119, 16957, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. A compelling image.</td>', 'Fantastic. A compelling image.', '2004-05-24 20:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(734292, 78901, 16982, '<td valign="top">Fascinating picture; I can''t wait to hear how you did it.</td>', 'Fascinating picture; I can''t wait to hear how you did it.', '2004-05-24 21:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(734308, 78634, 16957, '<td valign="top">What''s the unusual viewpoint? Lying on your back or flipping the photo in the horizontal plane? Not sure this works as there is not enough in the image to retain any great attention.</td>', 'What''s the unusual viewpoint? Lying on your back or flipping the photo in the horizontal plane? Not sure this works as there is not enough in the image to retain any great attention.', '2004-05-24 21:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(734310, 78835, 2634, '<td valign="top">just so thrilled with this one....you have displayed my dark roots well.<br/>I''m putting haircut and dye job on my list of things to do now :)</td>', 'just so thrilled with this one....you have displayed my dark roots well.I''m putting haircut and dye job on my list of things to do now :)', '2004-05-24 21:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(734315, 78450, 16957, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and textures.. Colours apoear too saturated for my taste though and this I feel detracts from the image. The hues draw me into the stone flags rather than the viewpoint draw me out to sea.</td>', 'Nice composition and textures.. Colours apoear too saturated for my taste though and this I feel detracts from the image. The hues draw me into the stone flags rather than the viewpoint draw me out to sea.', '2004-05-24 21:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(734362, 78581, 17837, '<td valign="top">Way to get down and dirty. I am glad that you focused far and not close. 7</td>', 'Way to get down and dirty. I am glad that you focused far and not close. 7', '2004-05-24 21:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(734366, 78091, 17837, '<td valign="top">I think in this photo, you should have used a smaller aperture. I think it would have been better if everyone was in focus. Just a personal opinion. 7</td>', 'I think in this photo, you should have used a smaller aperture. I think it would have been better if everyone was in focus. Just a personal opinion. 7', '2004-05-24 22:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
