(736229, 78362, 11895, '<td valign="top">lovely pic but I wish there was enough DoF to have her face in focus</td>', 'lovely pic but I wish there was enough DoF to have her face in focus', '2004-05-26 00:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(736232, 78849, 20496, '<td valign="top">its really easy to anthropomorphize this subject.  I like it!</td>', 'its really easy to anthropomorphize this subject.  I like it!', '2004-05-26 00:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(736234, 78451, 20496, '<td valign="top">The hand looks sort of sinister.  The reflections make it seem sort of like a natural cavern.</td>', 'The hand looks sort of sinister.  The reflections make it seem sort of like a natural cavern.', '2004-05-26 00:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(736242, 78877, 15920, '<td valign="top">Needs to be a little sharper, but, the colors and the composition are great.  DOF choice is also pretty good.</td>', 'Needs to be a little sharper, but, the colors and the composition are great.  DOF choice is also pretty good.', '2004-05-26 00:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(736248, 78881, 11518, '<td valign="top">LOL, very imaginative.  Well done. 10</td>', 'LOL, very imaginative.  Well done. 10', '2004-05-26 00:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(736250, 78903, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a nice pitcture, colors, composition, and focus all givea sense of quiet evening.  To go with your title though, I think you might need to be a lot closer to the ground/waterline. -7</td>', 'This is a nice pitcture, colors, composition, and focus all givea sense of quiet evening.  To go with your title though, I think you might need to be a lot closer to the ground/waterline. -7', '2004-05-26 00:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(736252, 78137, 15920, '<td valign="top">There is a fair amount of grain in this image.  It might have been clearer on a slower ASA setting.  Colors and composition are good.</td>', 'There is a fair amount of grain in this image.  It might have been clearer on a slower ASA setting.  Colors and composition are good.', '2004-05-26 00:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(736259, 78335, 15920, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  I generally don''t like photos with cats in them, but, this is great.  Excellent job all around, DOF perfect, focus good, supporting details, etc.  I hope you do very well.  -10</td>', 'Excellent composition.  I generally don''t like photos with cats in them, but, this is great.  Excellent job all around, DOF perfect, focus good, supporting details, etc.  I hope you do very well.  -10', '2004-05-26 00:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(736260, 78298, 11895, '<td valign="top">good capture, I like this but taking the noise out with Neat Image or the like would have improved it quite a bit</td>', 'good capture, I like this but taking the noise out with Neat Image or the like would have improved it quite a bit', '2004-05-26 00:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(736268, 78826, 15920, '<td valign="top">LOL!  A little more DOF would have scored higher, but thanks for sharing this, great title and composition. -7</td>', 'LOL!  A little more DOF would have scored higher, but thanks for sharing this, great title and composition. -7', '2004-05-26 00:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(736270, 78630, 15920, '<td valign="top">The non-level horizon isn''t something that generally makes me personally like a picture, but I am sure others will love it, so take that with a grain of salt.  A little more light inside the tunnel would have helped, as I find myself wanting to see just a touch more detail. -6</td>', 'The non-level horizon isn''t something that generally makes me personally like a picture, but I am sure others will love it, so take that with a grain of salt.  A little more light inside the tunnel would have helped, as I find myself wanting to see just a touch more detail. -6', '2004-05-26 00:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(736273, 78332, 7322, '<td valign="top">I love this for a few reasons. It''s funny without being condescending to the little person. I don''t know if it was intended but his small bum, protruding a bit is a direct diagonal to her bum. This harmony is strengthened by his obvious relish of her assets. :D My only suggestion is crop a bit off the top to eliminate the row of paintings and make her appear even taller in the frame, emphasizing his smallness.</td>', 'I love this for a few reasons. It''s funny without being condescending to the little person. I don''t know if it was intended but his small bum, protruding a bit is a direct diagonal to her bum. This harmony is strengthened by his obvious relish of her assets. :D My only suggestion is crop a bit off the top to eliminate the row of paintings and make her appear even taller in the frame, emphasizing his smallness.', '2004-05-26 00:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(736275, 78334, 7322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, moody lighting. Near perfect composition. My only complaint is the chair on the far right of the frame.</td>', 'Beautiful, moody lighting. Near perfect composition. My only complaint is the chair on the far right of the frame.', '2004-05-26 00:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(736280, 78712, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like this nature shot. It is refreshingly different from the plethora of nature photos on this forum. Some might complain about a little bit of fuzzines but I say, "Who cares?" The viewpoint works and the starkness enhances the otherwise homeliness of these birds (are they grackles? it''s hard to tell from this angle).</td>', 'I like this nature shot. It is refreshingly different from the plethora of nature photos on this forum. Some might complain about a little bit of fuzzines but I say, "Who cares?" The viewpoint works and the starkness enhances the otherwise homeliness of these birds (are they grackles? it''s hard to tell from this angle).', '2004-05-26 00:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(736281, 78871, 7322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color saturation, great design sense. Only wish the plastic pieces were black instead of grey but that is a minor nit.</td>', 'Beautiful color saturation, great design sense. Only wish the plastic pieces were black instead of grey but that is a minor nit.', '2004-05-26 00:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(736289, 78785, 7322, '<td valign="top">Excellent for this challenge. Several notches above similar approaches. Beautiful capture of the cat; its eye, whiskers, fur. Also, good call framing it so you only see one eye.</td>', 'Excellent for this challenge. Several notches above similar approaches. Beautiful capture of the cat; its eye, whiskers, fur. Also, good call framing it so you only see one eye.', '2004-05-26 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(736296, 77436, 7322, '<td valign="top">Really well done composition. It fills the frame perfectly with nothing extraneous.I like the simple color scheme of green and browns with the thin wedge of pale blue.<br/> <br/> I had a similar fence shot I did for this challenge (not as good--it''s in my portfolio if you feel like checking it out) but I didn''t enter it because I wasn''t sure it counted as an unusual viewpoint. I decided in the case of this photo it did. :D I''m curious what other voters will think. <br/></td>', 'Really well done composition. It fills the frame perfectly with nothing extraneous.I like the simple color scheme of green and browns with the thin wedge of pale blue.  I had a similar fence shot I did for this challenge (not as good--it''s in my portfolio if you feel like checking it out) but I didn''t enter it because I wasn''t sure it counted as an unusual viewpoint. I decided in the case of this photo it did. :D I''m curious what other voters will think. ', '2004-05-26 00:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(736300, 78004, 7322, '<td valign="top">Great colors and skin tone. Humorous with out being precious or too-too clever. Fills the frame beautifully.</td>', 'Great colors and skin tone. Humorous with out being precious or too-too clever. Fills the frame beautifully.', '2004-05-26 00:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(736304, 77494, 7322, '<td valign="top">I love a good cow shot and this counts. I just wish we could see the black cow''s eyes. The red cow almost reminds me of one of my dogs by her expression.</td>', 'I love a good cow shot and this counts. I just wish we could see the black cow''s eyes. The red cow almost reminds me of one of my dogs by her expression.', '2004-05-26 00:57:38.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(736349, 78911, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. Good perspective and interesting idea. You might try a little burning in and/or brightness/contrast on just the clouds to bring out a little more detail in them.</td>', 'Excellent image. Good perspective and interesting idea. You might try a little burning in and/or brightness/contrast on just the clouds to bring out a little more detail in them.', '2004-05-26 01:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(736350, 77830, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a viewpoint I could get used to. :)</td>', 'This is a viewpoint I could get used to. :)', '2004-05-26 01:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(736351, 78428, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting color combination and perspective.</td>', 'Interesting color combination and perspective.', '2004-05-26 01:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(736357, 78285, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellent image technically and a wonderful perspective. There is just a little noise in the sky you might consider removing.</td>', 'Excellent image technically and a wonderful perspective. There is just a little noise in the sky you might consider removing.', '2004-05-26 01:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(736366, 77871, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and good quality. Nice sharness and detail with just a little pixelation in the "outer" circles. Cropping might be slightly different to balance the amount of dome captured (There is a just a bit more on the bottom than the top) It is a tossup if cropping more off more of the dark right side would be better or not. Trimming off the right side lights looks better to me.</td>', 'Nice perspective and good quality. Nice sharness and detail with just a little pixelation in the "outer" circles. Cropping might be slightly different to balance the amount of dome captured (There is a just a bit more on the bottom than the top) It is a tossup if cropping more off more of the dark right side would be better or not. Trimming off the right side lights looks better to me.', '2004-05-26 01:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(736368, 78424, 8367, '<td valign="top">Great shot! You must have done the helicoptor ride that I wanted to do. It was pretty windy the day I was there and I chickened out.</td>', 'Great shot! You must have done the helicoptor ride that I wanted to do. It was pretty windy the day I was there and I chickened out.', '2004-05-26 01:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(736373, 77367, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image contains many elements of great interest for the viewer. Overall the general technical quality of the image is disappointing. It has been a long time since I''ve seen fireflies.</td>', 'This image contains many elements of great interest for the viewer. Overall the general technical quality of the image is disappointing. It has been a long time since I''ve seen fireflies.', '2004-05-26 01:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(736379, 77436, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and perpesective. You might try adjusting brightness/contrast or setting the black point if you use Photoshop to see if it looks better.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and perpesective. You might try adjusting brightness/contrast or setting the black point if you use Photoshop to see if it looks better.', '2004-05-26 01:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(736387, 78687, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image is unusual in that it lacks a specific area of the image in sharp focus normally reserved for the main subject.  This can be an effective technique that works well with greyscale. In this case it makes me wonder what you are really trying to say.</td>', 'This image is unusual in that it lacks a specific area of the image in sharp focus normally reserved for the main subject.  This can be an effective technique that works well with greyscale. In this case it makes me wonder what you are really trying to say.', '2004-05-26 01:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(736389, 78220, 5792, '<td valign="top">I just like this one a lot!</td>', 'I just like this one a lot!', '2004-05-26 01:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(736396, 77890, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellent, excellent image. Great technical quality and focus. You might try cropping the ladybug according to the rule of thirds (Perhaps to the lower right quadrant) to see what that would look like. Might make this already terrific image even better.</td>', 'Excellent, excellent image. Great technical quality and focus. You might try cropping the ladybug according to the rule of thirds (Perhaps to the lower right quadrant) to see what that would look like. Might make this already terrific image even better.', '2004-05-26 01:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(736404, 78868, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great central focus on the fly''s head. Even the smooth overexposure of the white petals works good. It would require considerable work but cloning out the petal that sticks out over the fly''s wing might be worth the effort.</td>', 'Great central focus on the fly''s head. Even the smooth overexposure of the white petals works good. It would require considerable work but cloning out the petal that sticks out over the fly''s wing might be worth the effort.', '2004-05-26 01:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(736410, 78064, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very nice persspective and composition but the pixelation in the building is distracting. Perhaps less sharpening or sharpening combined with a little gaussian blur and/or smudging would help reduce it. That could be a lot of work.</td>', 'Very nice persspective and composition but the pixelation in the building is distracting. Perhaps less sharpening or sharpening combined with a little gaussian blur and/or smudging would help reduce it. That could be a lot of work.', '2004-05-26 01:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(736417, 78377, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good perspective but you might try a little more contrast to make your subject stand out more.</td>', 'Good perspective but you might try a little more contrast to make your subject stand out more.', '2004-05-26 01:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(736420, 78884, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very original idea.</td>', 'Very original idea.', '2004-05-26 01:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(736427, 78296, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice capture. Original idea and fits the challenge to a "T". Congrats on a great shot.</td>', 'Very, very nice capture. Original idea and fits the challenge to a "T". Congrats on a great shot.', '2004-05-26 01:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(736437, 78427, 5792, '<td valign="top">When I see a Corona from this perspective it is usually empty. :) Great shot and good technical quality.</td>', 'When I see a Corona from this perspective it is usually empty. :) Great shot and good technical quality.', '2004-05-26 01:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(736449, 78028, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great idea for this challenge. Recropping the bottle opening to the intersection of ROT quadrants might be very effective with this image.</td>', 'Great idea for this challenge. Recropping the bottle opening to the intersection of ROT quadrants might be very effective with this image.', '2004-05-26 01:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(736459, 78424, 5792, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous view of Hoover Dam. Very nicely captured and the lighting is good. Excellent focus.</td>', 'What a gorgeous view of Hoover Dam. Very nicely captured and the lighting is good. Excellent focus.', '2004-05-26 02:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(736483, 78420, 5792, '<td valign="top">Making us folks that have never been to Toronto work to find out this was taken from the CN Tower Skypod, huh? It worked. Nice image.</td>', 'Making us folks that have never been to Toronto work to find out this was taken from the CN Tower Skypod, huh? It worked. Nice image.', '2004-05-26 02:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(736497, 77930, 5792, '<td valign="top">Everything about this image you did is very funny. Hope that is intentional.</td>', 'Everything about this image you did is very funny. Hope that is intentional.', '2004-05-26 02:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(736501, 78007, 22188, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan of waterfalls, especially ones that have the milky look to it. This is an interesting side to view it from also.</td>', 'I''m a fan of waterfalls, especially ones that have the milky look to it. This is an interesting side to view it from also.', '2004-05-26 02:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(736502, 78332, 5792, '<td valign="top">The photographer perspective on the bearded guy''s perspective is hilarious. Great choice for B&amp;W</td>', 'The photographer perspective on the bearded guy''s perspective is hilarious. Great choice for B&W', '2004-05-26 02:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(736519, 78871, 5792, '<td valign="top">Perspective and composition makes this image nice.</td>', 'Perspective and composition makes this image nice.', '2004-05-26 02:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(736537, 78207, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a childhood memory. Good use of the single color object in color.</td>', 'Great capture of a childhood memory. Good use of the single color object in color.', '2004-05-26 02:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(736545, 78081, 5792, '<td valign="top">Spectacular green tones in this image. Excellent image all the way around.</td>', 'Spectacular green tones in this image. Excellent image all the way around.', '2004-05-26 02:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(736577, 78667, 18552, '<td valign="top">Great Idea! Love the look on the man''s face. Don''t know if it would have been possible but it would have made the picture even nicer (IMO) if you could have cloned out the flash glare on the oven door or smudged it so it wasn''t so noticeable.</td>', 'Great Idea! Love the look on the man''s face. Don''t know if it would have been possible but it would have made the picture even nicer (IMO) if you could have cloned out the flash glare on the oven door or smudged it so it wasn''t so noticeable.', '2004-05-26 03:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(736580, 78881, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really a nice picture. Can''t give you any hints on how to make it better as it''s good the way it is. I love the reflection!</td>', 'Really a nice picture. Can''t give you any hints on how to make it better as it''s good the way it is. I love the reflection!', '2004-05-26 03:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(736581, 78097, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a cool picture. I can''t think of any helpful hints to make it better as I like it just like it is!</td>', 'What a cool picture. I can''t think of any helpful hints to make it better as I like it just like it is!', '2004-05-26 03:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(736583, 78296, 18552, '<td valign="top">Great idea; very well done. The little sparkle on the mirror adds just the right zing to make this a super picture.</td>', 'Great idea; very well done. The little sparkle on the mirror adds just the right zing to make this a super picture.', '2004-05-26 03:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(736585, 77930, 18552, '<td valign="top">Well composed. The sepia tone seems a bit too reddish and it seems a bit blurry.</td>', 'Well composed. The sepia tone seems a bit too reddish and it seems a bit blurry.', '2004-05-26 03:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(736588, 78816, 18552, '<td valign="top">Lovely, well focused picture of a hawk. To me, it doesn''t really show an unusual viewpoint. Also, to me, I would have liked the picture better without such a close crop - it looks like this poor bird has it''s wings chopped off.</td>', 'Lovely, well focused picture of a hawk. To me, it doesn''t really show an unusual viewpoint. Also, to me, I would have liked the picture better without such a close crop - it looks like this poor bird has it''s wings chopped off.', '2004-05-26 03:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(736591, 78729, 18552, '<td valign="top">The colors and focus are superb. To my mind, it doesn''t make the viewpoint seem more unusual to turn the picture upside down. It probably would have been better rightside up.</td>', 'The colors and focus are superb. To my mind, it doesn''t make the viewpoint seem more unusual to turn the picture upside down. It probably would have been better rightside up.', '2004-05-26 03:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(736595, 78028, 18552, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, I will be sure to look at the end of the challenge to see if you say how it was done. To me, it would have been more effective if the mouth would have been in focus and even more effective if there had been some Mountain Dew going into the mouth!</td>', 'Interesting photo, I will be sure to look at the end of the challenge to see if you say how it was done. To me, it would have been more effective if the mouth would have been in focus and even more effective if there had been some Mountain Dew going into the mouth!', '2004-05-26 03:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(736600, 78258, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a really good idea. To me, it would have been much more effective without the weird psychedelic colors and extreme grain.</td>', 'This is a really good idea. To me, it would have been much more effective without the weird psychedelic colors and extreme grain.', '2004-05-26 03:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(736603, 78135, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very pleasant picture, the colors and mood are great. I''ve looked at it several times and I can''t quite see what the unusual viewpoint is - perhaps it''s because you are looking down, a bit, at the ruins. To me, it doesn''t really seem like an unusual viewpoint.</td>', 'Very pleasant picture, the colors and mood are great. I''ve looked at it several times and I can''t quite see what the unusual viewpoint is - perhaps it''s because you are looking down, a bit, at the ruins. To me, it doesn''t really seem like an unusual viewpoint.', '2004-05-26 03:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(736610, 78064, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture with an unusual viewpint. To me, the sky looks a very unnatural color - can''t tell if it was that color or you somehow changed it to this color. All the lines on the building have a lot of jaggies, some of that is unavoidable but it looks like you might have some jpeg compression artifacts.</td>', 'Really nice picture with an unusual viewpint. To me, the sky looks a very unnatural color - can''t tell if it was that color or you somehow changed it to this color. All the lines on the building have a lot of jaggies, some of that is unavoidable but it looks like you might have some jpeg compression artifacts.', '2004-05-26 03:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(736891, 78007, 20395, '<td valign="top">It''s the 8th wonder of the world! The backside of water! Sorry, Disneyland jungle cruise nostalgia...</td>', 'It''s the 8th wonder of the world! The backside of water! Sorry, Disneyland jungle cruise nostalgia...', '2004-05-26 09:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(736993, 78428, 10985, '<td valign="top">Of all the "flowers seen from the bottom" shots, this one is the most original as it shows them in a vase. Original and colorful!</td>', 'Of all the "flowers seen from the bottom" shots, this one is the most original as it shows them in a vase. Original and colorful!', '2004-05-26 10:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(737016, 78735, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.</td>', 'Nice perspective.', '2004-05-26 10:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(737038, 78508, 8139, '<td valign="top">Better than with original colors. A bit harsh lightened IMO. But i like the surreal mood and semi abstract style. Unusual indeed.</td>', 'Better than with original colors. A bit harsh lightened IMO. But i like the surreal mood and semi abstract style. Unusual indeed.', '2004-05-26 11:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(737050, 77436, 8139, '<td valign="top">Should be improved by sharpening .</td>', 'Should be improved by sharpening .', '2004-05-26 11:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(737058, 77561, 14476, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in this composition.  Nice one.  10</td>', 'Love the colors in this composition.  Nice one.  10', '2004-05-26 11:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(737068, 78258, 8139, '<td valign="top">Fits well the theme. Colors oversaturation gives some "pop art" feeling, but the grain is really too much for my taste.</td>', 'Fits well the theme. Colors oversaturation gives some "pop art" feeling, but the grain is really too much for my taste.', '2004-05-26 11:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(737071, 78538, 8624, '<td valign="top">terrific perspective. the bird flying overhead is an extra nice detail.</td>', 'terrific perspective. the bird flying overhead is an extra nice detail.', '2004-05-26 11:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(737075, 78581, 8624, '<td valign="top">a good idea, but I think it would have been more effective to be looking at something in particular "through the grass".</td>', 'a good idea, but I think it would have been more effective to be looking at something in particular "through the grass".', '2004-05-26 11:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(737079, 78538, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like it very much.</td>', 'I like it very much.', '2004-05-26 11:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(737080, 78785, 17166, '<td valign="top">Excellent framing, very cute photo.</td>', 'Excellent framing, very cute photo.', '2004-05-26 11:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(737081, 78508, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2004-05-26 11:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(737082, 78285, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-05-26 11:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(737084, 78849, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful.</td>', 'Very beautiful.', '2004-05-26 11:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(737085, 77805, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2004-05-26 11:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(737086, 78450, 8139, '<td valign="top">I think this nice scape is overpostprocessed, specialy the sky and the blue of the sea is not natural. Is this effects where intended, well, ok, i just dislike them.</td>', 'I think this nice scape is overpostprocessed, specialy the sky and the blue of the sea is not natural. Is this effects where intended, well, ok, i just dislike them.', '2004-05-26 11:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(737279, 78538, 14476, '<td valign="top">Very well done!  Hope the ribon matches your color scheme.   10</td>', 'Very well done!  Hope the ribon matches your color scheme.   10', '2004-05-26 12:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(737280, 77890, 14476, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro.  Good luck with this fine image.  10</td>', 'Excellent macro.  Good luck with this fine image.  10', '2004-05-26 12:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(737284, 78081, 14476, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color work in this one.  It''s destined to be one of my favorites, for sure.  10</td>', 'Beautiful color work in this one.  It''s destined to be one of my favorites, for sure.  10', '2004-05-26 12:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(737286, 78829, 14476, '<td valign="top">I know how difficult these are to get, and you did a super job.  10</td>', 'I know how difficult these are to get, and you did a super job.  10', '2004-05-26 12:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
