(737776, 78481, 15029, '<td valign="top">This is ginuinely hilarious. I love it! Th DOF is perfect.  IMHO It might have been better if shot was from a lower angle, looking up a bit more.</td>', 'This is ginuinely hilarious. I love it! Th DOF is perfect.  IMHO It might have been better if shot was from a lower angle, looking up a bit more.', '2004-05-26 17:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(737835, 78342, 10047, '<td valign="top">Well done. Clear and crisp. Nice use of the upper right corner for natural framing.</td>', 'Well done. Clear and crisp. Nice use of the upper right corner for natural framing.', '2004-05-26 18:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(737838, 78903, 10047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful surface texture, and complementing colors.</td>', 'Beautiful surface texture, and complementing colors.', '2004-05-26 18:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(737842, 77672, 10047, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but I''m not sure what it is. I like the moody background. The two ends look a little over processed.</td>', 'Interesting, but I''m not sure what it is. I like the moody background. The two ends look a little over processed.', '2004-05-26 18:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(737850, 78829, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Good effect with the light and shadow.</td>', 'Nicely done. Good effect with the light and shadow.', '2004-05-26 18:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(737853, 78064, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting colors.</td>', 'Nice contrasting colors.', '2004-05-26 18:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(737856, 78878, 10047, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you had to work with but the positioning in the picture seems a little odd. Nice capture though.</td>', 'Not sure what you had to work with but the positioning in the picture seems a little odd. Nice capture though.', '2004-05-26 18:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(737874, 78903, 16957, '<td valign="top">Nicely observed and what wondrous colours, textures and framing. Well done. A particularly effective composition and use of colours in reflected sunset.</td>', 'Nicely observed and what wondrous colours, textures and framing. Well done. A particularly effective composition and use of colours in reflected sunset.', '2004-05-26 18:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(737878, 78841, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional photo.  Great composition with the leading line bringing you in from the bottom.  Great exposure with detail even in the very dark steps.  Go from a 9 to  a 10 if:  a) The bright white area in the top were toned down a bit and b) There was another color towards the top of the steps (model in red , umbrella, or anything that was a "destination" for the great leading lines."  Overall.  One of the best in show.</td>', 'Exceptional photo.  Great composition with the leading line bringing you in from the bottom.  Great exposure with detail even in the very dark steps.  Go from a 9 to  a 10 if:  a) The bright white area in the top were toned down a bit and b) There was another color towards the top of the steps (model in red , umbrella, or anything that was a "destination" for the great leading lines."  Overall.  One of the best in show.', '2004-05-26 18:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(737880, 77923, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting take on unusual viewpoint, but not very exciting.  You handled your focus area very well.</td>', 'It''s an interesting take on unusual viewpoint, but not very exciting.  You handled your focus area very well.', '2004-05-26 18:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(737882, 77494, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of the wide angle lens.  It''s a great shot - one of my favorites.  Improve it eevn more by:  a) Better lighting on the faces - especially the animal on the right, b) Catchlight in the visible eyes and c) Remove the white part of the border.  It draws attention way from the image.  (The ear tag is unfortunate photographically but a fact of life these days.)</td>', 'Wonderful use of the wide angle lens.  It''s a great shot - one of my favorites.  Improve it eevn more by:  a) Better lighting on the faces - especially the animal on the right, b) Catchlight in the visible eyes and c) Remove the white part of the border.  It draws attention way from the image.  (The ear tag is unfortunate photographically but a fact of life these days.)', '2004-05-26 18:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(737885, 78581, 19608, '<td valign="top">It certainly is an unusual viewpoint but that''s about it.  No real subject, a lot OOF, good exposure.</td>', 'It certainly is an unusual viewpoint but that''s about it.  No real subject, a lot OOF, good exposure.', '2004-05-26 18:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(737889, 78808, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ah - a real piece of artwork.  Great use of leading lines that take the viewer into a well exposed and dynamic scene.  Sky a bit hot - right at the top - consider cropping just a bit out - it won''t hurt the image if you do.  That''s the only minor comment I have on this - one of the best in the show.</td>', 'Ah - a real piece of artwork.  Great use of leading lines that take the viewer into a well exposed and dynamic scene.  Sky a bit hot - right at the top - consider cropping just a bit out - it won''t hurt the image if you do.  That''s the only minor comment I have on this - one of the best in the show.', '2004-05-26 18:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(737896, 78785, 19608, '<td valign="top">Neat idea and extremely well done!  Great composition and exposure.  I usually like to make a suggestion for improvement, but there absolutely nothing I would suggest.  Congrats on meetung the challenge in an artistic and techically correct way!</td>', 'Neat idea and extremely well done!  Great composition and exposure.  I usually like to make a suggestion for improvement, but there absolutely nothing I would suggest.  Congrats on meetung the challenge in an artistic and techically correct way!', '2004-05-26 18:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(737900, 78630, 19608, '<td valign="top">I assume this is a snowbridge - which s certainly an unusual viewpoint.  Very difficult to read - probably too great a light variance to hle both the highlights and the shadows. The diagonal placement is a bit unnerving to me.</td>', 'I assume this is a snowbridge - which s certainly an unusual viewpoint.  Very difficult to read - probably too great a light variance to hle both the highlights and the shadows. The diagonal placement is a bit unnerving to me.', '2004-05-26 18:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(737906, 78007, 19608, '<td valign="top">Gee - doesn''t everyone get behind a waterfall every day?  DEFINITELY an unusual viewpoint - nice find.  Your use of a tripod (I assume) and perhaps an ND filter to slow the shutter and capture the velvet look to the water is great.   Sky a teeny bit hot - and the halo around the top of the waterfall looks a bit unnatural.  Overall an excellent submission.</td>', 'Gee - doesn''t everyone get behind a waterfall every day?  DEFINITELY an unusual viewpoint - nice find.  Your use of a tripod (I assume) and perhaps an ND filter to slow the shutter and capture the velvet look to the water is great.   Sky a teeny bit hot - and the halo around the top of the waterfall looks a bit unnatural.  Overall an excellent submission.', '2004-05-26 18:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(737909, 78298, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and "feel" to the water - the ripples are a treat.</td>', 'Nice colors and "feel" to the water - the ripples are a treat.', '2004-05-26 18:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(737911, 78871, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of viewpont - composition is the strong part of this image.  Colors ok - but could be a bit more vibrant.  Lots of compression or other noise, especially in the yellow and orange.  Still a submission that should do well.</td>', 'Nice choice of viewpont - composition is the strong part of this image.  Colors ok - but could be a bit more vibrant.  Lots of compression or other noise, especially in the yellow and orange.  Still a submission that should do well.', '2004-05-26 18:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(737912, 78485, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting on an exceptional scene - perfect time of day.  As far as an "unusual viewpoint"  - don''t think so.</td>', 'Excellent lighting on an exceptional scene - perfect time of day.  As far as an "unusual viewpoint"  - don''t think so.', '2004-05-26 18:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(737964, 78704, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent viewpoint!  Too bad the mail is bills!  Great exposure - nice lighting on the face yet some detail on the inside of the "mailbox."   DoF handled perfectly.  My only complaint is that white sky - but that is offset a bit by the white in the envelopes.  Still an excellent and very ORIGINAL submission.</td>', 'Excellent viewpoint!  Too bad the mail is bills!  Great exposure - nice lighting on the face yet some detail on the inside of the "mailbox."   DoF handled perfectly.  My only complaint is that white sky - but that is offset a bit by the white in the envelopes.  Still an excellent and very ORIGINAL submission.', '2004-05-26 19:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(737972, 77890, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ususual viewpoint - yes.  Interesting - yes.  Make it better by:  a) Not centering the main subject b) Remove that bright and distracting white area on the left edge.</td>', 'Ususual viewpoint - yes.  Interesting - yes.  Make it better by:  a) Not centering the main subject b) Remove that bright and distracting white area on the left edge.', '2004-05-26 19:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(737977, 78250, 19608, '<td valign="top">Definitely an unusual viewpoint.  Nice backlighting, good colors.  Frog a bit mysterious but that''s ok.  Composition violates a rule or two, but it works very well - one time to toss out the rules.</td>', 'Definitely an unusual viewpoint.  Nice backlighting, good colors.  Frog a bit mysterious but that''s ok.  Composition violates a rule or two, but it works very well - one time to toss out the rules.', '2004-05-26 19:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(737979, 77903, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, great shadows.  Sitting behind the netting is a "tiny bit" unusual if you stretch things a bit.  Taking it as the batter was swinging would add more impact - even if the bat''s a total blur.</td>', 'Nice lighting, great shadows.  Sitting behind the netting is a "tiny bit" unusual if you stretch things a bit.  Taking it as the batter was swinging would add more impact - even if the bat''s a total blur.', '2004-05-26 19:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(737987, 78877, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and shapes.  Definitely an unusual viewpoint.  Make it better by: a) More area in focus, b) Way less compression in post shoot processing - use more of the 150k limit (this is just 46k) to prevent the "banding" as the color changes.</td>', 'Nice colors and shapes.  Definitely an unusual viewpoint.  Make it better by: a) More area in focus, b) Way less compression in post shoot processing - use more of the 150k limit (this is just 46k) to prevent the "banding" as the color changes.', '2004-05-26 19:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(737995, 77805, 19608, '<td valign="top">Interesting flower in a great color combination with the green.  DoF handled very well.  Flat lighting a plus.  Unusual viewpoint - not for a photographer - but probably for most folks. Perhaps it should not be so dead center.</td>', 'Interesting flower in a great color combination with the green.  DoF handled very well.  Flat lighting a plus.  Unusual viewpoint - not for a photographer - but probably for most folks. Perhaps it should not be so dead center.', '2004-05-26 19:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(738000, 78587, 19608, '<td valign="top">Strong composition.  Nice lines.  Too bad there wasn''t a rather large white bird in one of the blue areas to geive it a real "wow" factor.  Thanks for sharing - it''s a great job.</td>', 'Strong composition.  Nice lines.  Too bad there wasn''t a rather large white bird in one of the blue areas to geive it a real "wow" factor.  Thanks for sharing - it''s a great job.', '2004-05-26 19:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(738191, 78650, 16385, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2004-05-26 20:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(738198, 78901, 16385, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2004-05-26 21:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(738245, 78826, 16775, '<td valign="top">what if you placed the camera as if the person buried were looking up from their grave?<br/> <br/>the tombstone would be upside down at the top of the frame....maybe too spooky...</td>', 'what if you placed the camera as if the person buried were looking up from their grave? the tombstone would be upside down at the top of the frame....maybe too spooky...', '2004-05-26 21:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(738262, 78793, 16775, '<td valign="top">very manipulative...i like<br/> <br/>i wonder if less light in the face would have produced a better reflection...</td>', 'very manipulative...i like i wonder if less light in the face would have produced a better reflection...', '2004-05-26 21:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(738269, 77384, 16775, '<td valign="top">the border is a little overworked...especially for a subject so clean and contemporary.<br/> <br/>but i love the view and the rotation.  nice work.</td>', 'the border is a little overworked...especially for a subject so clean and contemporary. but i love the view and the rotation.  nice work.', '2004-05-26 21:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(738349, 78735, 10680, '<td valign="top">very nice capture! this is definitely an interesting viewpoint. My only nitpick is the leaf in front that''s just out of focus, and sort of blocking the bench. otherwise, excellent!</td>', 'very nice capture! this is definitely an interesting viewpoint. My only nitpick is the leaf in front that''s just out of focus, and sort of blocking the bench. otherwise, excellent!', '2004-05-26 23:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
