(738411, 78250, 10680, '<td valign="top">wow great capture! good job getting the sky exposed well. I think if i were to nitpick, I''d like to see the frog a little bit more centered, or less of the other leaves up top, but that''s just nitpicking. Great shot<br/></td>', 'wow great capture! good job getting the sky exposed well. I think if i were to nitpick, I''d like to see the frog a little bit more centered, or less of the other leaves up top, but that''s just nitpicking. Great shot', '2004-05-26 23:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(738541, 78538, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful picture. The bird is cool, but probably more of a distraction than anything. The clarity on the flower is nice really high up, but a bit more clarity near the bottom would have improved the shot since it takes up so much more real estate than the top of the flower. But that''s just being picky. This is a great shot.</td>', 'Wow, beautiful picture. The bird is cool, but probably more of a distraction than anything. The clarity on the flower is nice really high up, but a bit more clarity near the bottom would have improved the shot since it takes up so much more real estate than the top of the flower. But that''s just being picky. This is a great shot.', '2004-05-27 01:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(738548, 78705, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity and a really great action shot from an odd perspective. Although now I''m craving bad pizza... Great job!</td>', 'Nice clarity and a really great action shot from an odd perspective. Although now I''m craving bad pizza... Great job!', '2004-05-27 01:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
