(739075, 77362, 9906, '<td valign="top">I find your use of selective desaturation to be kind of confusing in this shot.  Your title says look at the restaurant.  The guy in me says look at the cute girl.  The hat SCREAMS look at me and doesn''t seem to make much sense in this example...<br/>TC</td>', 'I find your use of selective desaturation to be kind of confusing in this shot.  Your title says look at the restaurant.  The guy in me says look at the cute girl.  The hat SCREAMS look at me and doesn''t seem to make much sense in this example...TC', '2004-05-27 10:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
