(739154, 78783, 2612, '<td valign="top">The flower needs better focus in order for this to work for me. Good concept and the execution was almost there.</td>', 'The flower needs better focus in order for this to work for me. Good concept and the execution was almost there.', '2004-05-27 11:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
