(739162, 78450, 2612, '<td valign="top">It''s a great viewpoint.... but maybe not that unusual.<br/>With that said, I''m going with a relatively high score because:<br/>I really like the composition<br/>The color of the rock stands out nicely against the blue background<br/>Good texture and the small building is nicely exposed<br/>Great clouds<br/></td>', 'It''s a great viewpoint.... but maybe not that unusual.With that said, I''m going with a relatively high score because:I really like the compositionThe color of the rock stands out nicely against the blue backgroundGood texture and the small building is nicely exposedGreat clouds', '2004-05-27 11:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(739197, 77561, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great composition and colors.  The inward swirl really makes the shot.</td>', 'Great composition and colors.  The inward swirl really makes the shot.', '2004-05-27 12:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(739202, 78773, 19608, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal composition, your handling of DoF,and  the blue of the string matching the nice sky.  Not sure it''s much of an unusual viewpoint.</td>', 'I like the diagonal composition, your handling of DoF,and  the blue of the string matching the nice sky.  Not sure it''s much of an unusual viewpoint.', '2004-05-27 12:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(739204, 78543, 19608, '<td valign="top">Neat idea and well executed.  One of the more original unusual viewpoints.  Compositionally it would be better if there were no merger of the two upper insects.</td>', 'Neat idea and well executed.  One of the more original unusual viewpoints.  Compositionally it would be better if there were no merger of the two upper insects.', '2004-05-27 12:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(739205, 78873, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  I like the way the light falls off to darkness at the top.</td>', 'Nice portrait.  I like the way the light falls off to darkness at the top.', '2004-05-27 12:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(739208, 78863, 19608, '<td valign="top">Good use of the wide angle lens - and stopped it down enough to hold great DoF.  Puffy clouds add interest.</td>', 'Good use of the wide angle lens - and stopped it down enough to hold great DoF.  Puffy clouds add interest.', '2004-05-27 12:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
