(739835, 78903, 14255, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, I love the sky and the reflections in the water. This is one perfect picture hence 10 points given.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, I love the sky and the reflections in the water. This is one perfect picture hence 10 points given.', '2004-05-27 19:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(739896, 78450, 20204, '<td valign="top">This is almost surreal.  The detail in the texture of the stones is incredible.  I really like the use of space in this as well.  The dramatic sky is the icing on the cake.  I really enjoyed this image.</td>', 'This is almost surreal.  The detail in the texture of the stones is incredible.  I really like the use of space in this as well.  The dramatic sky is the icing on the cake.  I really enjoyed this image.', '2004-05-27 20:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(739904, 77641, 20204, '<td valign="top">The exposure is so nicely done with the sky and water that I don''t I''d even need the sandals to enjoy this.  I do like the idea though!  I''m thinking that if they didn''t dominate so much of frame and were more subtle, the image would work even better.  Great job!</td>', 'The exposure is so nicely done with the sky and water that I don''t I''d even need the sandals to enjoy this.  I do like the idea though!  I''m thinking that if they didn''t dominate so much of frame and were more subtle, the image would work even better.  Great job!', '2004-05-27 20:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(739906, 78841, 20204, '<td valign="top">IGreat use of the full frame to really bring out your subject.  These stairs are amazing!  The deeply saturated green aurrounding them is a great contrast with the less colorful stone.  All in all a very well composed and enjoyable image.</td>', 'IGreat use of the full frame to really bring out your subject.  These stairs are amazing!  The deeply saturated green aurrounding them is a great contrast with the less colorful stone.  All in all a very well composed and enjoyable image.', '2004-05-27 21:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
