(741502, 78334, 17033, '<td valign="top">interesting pic but I''m not sure about the meaning or intention.Why have you burned the face of the subject? What is the white smoke/dirty window/her reflection to her right?  mystery is good, though. thought-provoking.</td>', 'interesting pic but I''m not sure about the meaning or intention.Why have you burned the face of the subject? What is the white smoke/dirty window/her reflection to her right?  mystery is good, though. thought-provoking.', '2004-05-29 05:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(741503, 78182, 17033, '<td valign="top">not so unusual</td>', 'not so unusual', '2004-05-29 05:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(741504, 78169, 17033, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation of the challenge, well done. not sure about being so rigid with corner to corner diagonal....might have felt more relaxed if sky had hit the border less geometrically....but like it overall</td>', 'Nice interpretation of the challenge, well done. not sure about being so rigid with corner to corner diagonal....might have felt more relaxed if sky had hit the border less geometrically....but like it overall', '2004-05-29 05:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(741505, 77436, 17033, '<td valign="top">contrast</td>', 'contrast', '2004-05-29 05:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(741506, 78911, 17033, '<td valign="top">not sure if it meets the challenge rules or spirit, but have you thought of burning on a reflection of the sign on the building to make people do a double-take on the their percieved size of the sign? might be fun.</td>', 'not sure if it meets the challenge rules or spirit, but have you thought of burning on a reflection of the sign on the building to make people do a double-take on the their percieved size of the sign? might be fun.', '2004-05-29 05:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(741507, 78711, 17033, '<td valign="top">looks like you''ve altered something around the light...bit messy. Nice idea, shapes, colours but the framing/composition is not right......I gues it gets over the idea of lokking into space but it feels awkward</td>', 'looks like you''ve altered something around the light...bit messy. Nice idea, shapes, colours but the framing/composition is not right......I gues it gets over the idea of lokking into space but it feels awkward', '2004-05-29 05:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(741508, 78091, 17033, '<td valign="top">You might have exagerated he effect by just depicting the conrast between the raised (seated) feet and the lone batter''s feet walking out. The kit in the middle breaks the nice line of feet</td>', 'You might have exagerated he effect by just depicting the conrast between the raised (seated) feet and the lone batter''s feet walking out. The kit in the middle breaks the nice line of feet', '2004-05-29 05:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(741509, 77557, 17033, '<td valign="top">the subject is the cat so the unusual viewpoint should show us the cat from a new angle...instead, you have focussed attention on the drawer handles, chair legs and sticker under the chair. how about really getting down on the floor and taking a pic of your cat curiously peering over the edge of the chair as if to say ''what are you doing now?''..my cat would say that!</td>', 'the subject is the cat so the unusual viewpoint should show us the cat from a new angle...instead, you have focussed attention on the drawer handles, chair legs and sticker under the chair. how about really getting down on the floor and taking a pic of your cat curiously peering over the edge of the chair as if to say ''what are you doing now?''..my cat would say that!', '2004-05-29 05:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(741510, 77919, 17033, '<td valign="top">more of the surounding building would help ''set the scene'' here i think</td>', 'more of the surounding building would help ''set the scene'' here i think', '2004-05-29 05:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(741514, 78332, 17033, '<td valign="top">how about cropping out the woman to the left or did you feel she emphasised the guy''s size? The picture directly behind him distracts. I don''t know if this is a case where the photographer should ask the permission of the subject before taklng the photo?</td>', 'how about cropping out the woman to the left or did you feel she emphasised the guy''s size? The picture directly behind him distracts. I don''t know if this is a case where the photographer should ask the permission of the subject before taklng the photo?', '2004-05-29 05:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(741516, 78338, 17033, '<td valign="top">i think you should have cropped out everything in the bottom third or got to a different position/angle to take the shot</td>', 'i think you should have cropped out everything in the bottom third or got to a different position/angle to take the shot', '2004-05-29 05:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(741517, 78357, 17033, '<td valign="top">the plastic isn''t very attractive</td>', 'the plastic isn''t very attractive', '2004-05-29 05:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
