(742517, 78785, 16982, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t be more pleased that one of the finest photographs in the challenge is of a cat.  I''m sure this will do very well.</td>', 'I couldn''t be more pleased that one of the finest photographs in the challenge is of a cat.  I''m sure this will do very well.', '2004-05-30 13:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(742547, 78785, 7560, '<td valign="top">One of my top three images for this challenge.  You have excellent sharpness in this image. The color contrast of the cat and the dark mousehole works well. Looks like he has a little eye schmutz which you might have cleaned. But that''s just me being incredibly picky. Great DOF on the cat/background. Best part is getting the cat to agree with what you wanted him to do. As a cat owner, I know how tough that is. Very nicely done. 10</td>', 'One of my top three images for this challenge.  You have excellent sharpness in this image. The color contrast of the cat and the dark mousehole works well. Looks like he has a little eye schmutz which you might have cleaned. But that''s just me being incredibly picky. Great DOF on the cat/background. Best part is getting the cat to agree with what you wanted him to do. As a cat owner, I know how tough that is. Very nicely done. 10', '2004-05-30 14:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(742549, 78626, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love the composition in this image. The wide open sidewalk space really makes this a very strong shot. This is a good example of how you can use strong light to your advantage when shooting. Depending on the original, I might have conisdered playing with the crop. Possibly rotating it to a 45 degree angle. Nice job, one of my top images. 10</td>', 'I love the composition in this image. The wide open sidewalk space really makes this a very strong shot. This is a good example of how you can use strong light to your advantage when shooting. Depending on the original, I might have conisdered playing with the crop. Possibly rotating it to a 45 degree angle. Nice job, one of my top images. 10', '2004-05-30 14:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(742551, 78450, 7560, '<td valign="top">The color and leading lines in this shot really sold me.  It''s a bit overly saturated, but in this case I like the effect. Great use of leading lines. 10</td>', 'The color and leading lines in this shot really sold me.  It''s a bit overly saturated, but in this case I like the effect. Great use of leading lines. 10', '2004-05-30 14:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(742570, 78097, 7560, '<td valign="top">Excellent eye! The strong spiraling lines pull you naturally into the image. The diners are an unexpected surprise. The people on the second landing are a bit distracting, but not enough for me to drop the vote on the image. 9</td>', 'Excellent eye! The strong spiraling lines pull you naturally into the image. The diners are an unexpected surprise. The people on the second landing are a bit distracting, but not enough for me to drop the vote on the image. 9', '2004-05-30 14:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(742575, 78119, 9462, '<td valign="top">wOw.. I haven''t gone thru all the entries yet but this is my blue ribbon pick. I can''t think of anything that could be improved upon.... just perfect :)</td>', 'wOw.. I haven''t gone thru all the entries yet but this is my blue ribbon pick. I can''t think of anything that could be improved upon.... just perfect :)', '2004-05-30 14:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
