(742588, 78735, 7560, '<td valign="top">A different view through a common object. I like the choice of black and white for this one. Nice grain to the image. The leaf in the foreground is a bit distracting. I might have actually removed it from the tree. Very nice! 9</td>', 'A different view through a common object. I like the choice of black and white for this one. Nice grain to the image. The leaf in the foreground is a bit distracting. I might have actually removed it from the tree. Very nice! 9', '2004-05-30 15:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
