(742592, 78296, 7560, '<td valign="top">You are a week late for threes! :) Great idea and execution. Like the use of multiple mirrors. Kudos to your model who probably had to spend a bit of time standing around while you got the right angle. :) 9</td>', 'You are a week late for threes! :) Great idea and execution. Like the use of multiple mirrors. Kudos to your model who probably had to spend a bit of time standing around while you got the right angle. :) 9', '2004-05-30 15:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(742594, 78561, 7560, '<td valign="top">That''s an incredibly clean fridge. My favorite of the looking out from an appliance shots. I like the combination of cans and bottles. I also like the beer being the focus, not the face of the person opening the fridge. Now the question is, how the heck do you figure out metering in a fridge!? 8</td>', 'That''s an incredibly clean fridge. My favorite of the looking out from an appliance shots. I like the combination of cans and bottles. I also like the beer being the focus, not the face of the person opening the fridge. Now the question is, how the heck do you figure out metering in a fridge!? 8', '2004-05-30 15:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(742600, 78688, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great use of repeating patterns and lines. The model breaks up the image nicely. Her leg seems to blend into the desk a bit. I''d have used lighter pants to stand out against the dark wood maybe? Desk 117 is also a bit of an off element due to the darker wood. Maybe move over a row or two? 8<br/></td>', 'Great use of repeating patterns and lines. The model breaks up the image nicely. Her leg seems to blend into the desk a bit. I''d have used lighter pants to stand out against the dark wood maybe? Desk 117 is also a bit of an off element due to the darker wood. Maybe move over a row or two? 8', '2004-05-30 15:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(742604, 77919, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love the very stark graphical element ehre. Just a touch of action at the corners, and those great lines drawing me towards the center. 8</td>', 'I love the very stark graphical element ehre. Just a touch of action at the corners, and those great lines drawing me towards the center. 8', '2004-05-30 15:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(742608, 77903, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love this angle. It''s one you don''t see often in sports photography. I also like the choice to include the backstop netting rather than trying to blur it out. The strong light and shadows remind me of summer softball games when I was a kid. 7</td>', 'I love this angle. It''s one you don''t see often in sports photography. I also like the choice to include the backstop netting rather than trying to blur it out. The strong light and shadows remind me of summer softball games when I was a kid. 7', '2004-05-30 15:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(742612, 78841, 7560, '<td valign="top">This image feels off. Like it;s either out of focus or you were going for a very soft feel. It''s off just enough that I have to strain a bit when looking at the image. That said, I love the colors and contrast. Beautiful greens, and I love the rain puddles. 7</td>', 'This image feels off. Like it;s either out of focus or you were going for a very soft feel. It''s off just enough that I have to strain a bit when looking at the image. That said, I love the colors and contrast. Beautiful greens, and I love the rain puddles. 7', '2004-05-30 15:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(742615, 78319, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nice sillouette! So the first question is, how long did it take you to get this image? :) Great idea. I love the clouds, and the circular trash can creates a great crop. 7</td>', 'Nice sillouette! So the first question is, how long did it take you to get this image? :) Great idea. I love the clouds, and the circular trash can creates a great crop. 7', '2004-05-30 15:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
