(742804, 78471, 13602, '<td valign="top">this is a verry interesting perspective, I like it alot, the lines are great. I think (and this is only my choice, would not make your choice whorse) it would be verry interesting to see a partial desaturation of this leaving just the red from the lined up chairs, making all the rest b/w including the big chair at the end. Great shot anyways.</td>', 'this is a verry interesting perspective, I like it alot, the lines are great. I think (and this is only my choice, would not make your choice whorse) it would be verry interesting to see a partial desaturation of this leaving just the red from the lined up chairs, making all the rest b/w including the big chair at the end. Great shot anyways.', '2004-05-30 18:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(742833, 78420, 13602, '<td valign="top">I agree the point of view here is great, I like the shot alot, but I don''t find it unusual. Great but not unusual. - 8</td>', 'I agree the point of view here is great, I like the shot alot, but I don''t find it unusual. Great but not unusual. - 8', '2004-05-30 19:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(742878, 77930, 20324, '<td valign="top">It is somehow disturbing and scary, positions the viewer in a really unusual point of wive, unless it is a robber. Why the smile? I did change the comment - I dont  want to generalize, its not fair. From artistic point of view it is a good composition and close by effect. (8)</td>', 'It is somehow disturbing and scary, positions the viewer in a really unusual point of wive, unless it is a robber. Why the smile? I did change the comment - I dont  want to generalize, its not fair. From artistic point of view it is a good composition and close by effect. (8)', '2004-05-30 20:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(742885, 78119, 18349, '<td valign="top">My pick for the blue...love this shot.  Very unique.</td>', 'My pick for the blue...love this shot.  Very unique.', '2004-05-30 20:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(742886, 78285, 18349, '<td valign="top">One of my top three!  Love the colors, the contrast, the expression...wonderful!</td>', 'One of my top three!  Love the colors, the contrast, the expression...wonderful!', '2004-05-30 20:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(742887, 78169, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very unusual viewpoint.  One of my top three picks.  I like the post treatment and the angle.  Great work!</td>', 'Very unusual viewpoint.  One of my top three picks.  I like the post treatment and the angle.  Great work!', '2004-05-30 20:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(742889, 77871, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very nice (and the fact that I''m a native Texan has NOTHING to do with it)!  I love the warmth and tone.  Nice!</td>', 'Very nice (and the fact that I''m a native Texan has NOTHING to do with it)!  I love the warmth and tone.  Nice!', '2004-05-30 20:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(742890, 77494, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The only thing I would suggest is adjusting the contrast a tad so that the black cow''s eyes and facial features might be more visible.   Great angle! :o)</td>', 'Very nice.  The only thing I would suggest is adjusting the contrast a tad so that the black cow''s eyes and facial features might be more visible.   Great angle! :o)', '2004-05-30 20:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
