(742900, 78813, 18349, '<td valign="top">I know that this is unusual, as most people don''t have mop families propped on their fences and all, but it just really isn''t my taste.  IMHO I don''t find it that visually appealing.  Sorry! :o)</td>', 'I know that this is unusual, as most people don''t have mop families propped on their fences and all, but it just really isn''t my taste.  IMHO I don''t find it that visually appealing.  Sorry! :o)', '2004-05-30 20:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
