(743865, 78601, 12448, '<td valign="top">I gave this shot a four.  I see what you were going for but I had to visualize a lot of it because of the angle of the shot.  If you could take the shot from on top of the barrel or pole so you are directing the camera  right at the boat it''s aimed out it would have a much bigger impact.  Also the colors are dull, hard to work with on an overcast day but with a little tweeking in an editing program, even with the brightness and contrast could really make a difference. :)<br/> <br/>Hope this helps!<br/> <br/>Deannda</td>', 'I gave this shot a four.  I see what you were going for but I had to visualize a lot of it because of the angle of the shot.  If you could take the shot from on top of the barrel or pole so you are directing the camera  right at the boat it''s aimed out it would have a much bigger impact.  Also the colors are dull, hard to work with on an overcast day but with a little tweeking in an editing program, even with the brightness and contrast could really make a difference. :) Hope this helps! Deannda', '2004-05-31 10:41:37.000000', NULL, 0),
