(743881, 78601, 8891, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6. What I like about is the focus, the composition and the color scheme.  I am great fan of cloud shots and I like these in the background. What I did not like is the subject. Sorry I''ve gone very anti-violence. Also, while the composition is very favorable, I do not like the tilt of the picture with the horizon on an angle. Also what might have helped in this is a sligt crop on the left to remove the clutter from beside the ''target''.<br/>Just do not have the time to comment anymore....hope this helps. If I confused you at all, let me know and I''ll try to explain further. RoB</td>', 'I gave this a 6. What I like about is the focus, the composition and the color scheme.  I am great fan of cloud shots and I like these in the background. What I did not like is the subject. Sorry I''ve gone very anti-violence. Also, while the composition is very favorable, I do not like the tilt of the picture with the horizon on an angle. Also what might have helped in this is a sligt crop on the left to remove the clutter from beside the ''target''.Just do not have the time to comment anymore....hope this helps. If I confused you at all, let me know and I''ll try to explain further. RoB', '2004-05-31 11:07:43.000000', NULL, 0),
