(744931, 78601, 7322, '<td valign="top">Sorry not to have commented sooner. I''m still catching up on my comments after voting on every photo of the last four challenges. :D<br/> <br/>I initially gave this a higher score because of the excellent sharpness of the image. However, on second look I thought it was a bit busy and without a real focal point. The barrel is pointing at the white boat which seems to make the boat the focal point but it just isn''t that interesting. The tripod thing interrupts the view. What really detracts from the photo is easily discernable strip of grass and parking lot which introduce the mundane into what is meant to be a dramatic shot.</td>', 'Sorry not to have commented sooner. I''m still catching up on my comments after voting on every photo of the last four challenges. :D I initially gave this a higher score because of the excellent sharpness of the image. However, on second look I thought it was a bit busy and without a real focal point. The barrel is pointing at the white boat which seems to make the boat the focal point but it just isn''t that interesting. The tripod thing interrupts the view. What really detracts from the photo is easily discernable strip of grass and parking lot which introduce the mundane into what is meant to be a dramatic shot.', '2004-06-01 01:44:45.000000', NULL, 0),
