(747326, 78785, 22525, '<td valign="top">Light is great.  But that is what we expect from the  gig. Bet Monster is jealous.</td>', 'Light is great.  But that is what we expect from the  gig. Bet Monster is jealous.', '2004-06-02 14:54:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(747504, 78119, 5112, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gutzanu:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s a miracle :)) It''s remarcable! Did you edit your photo after taking it? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Of course :)))  Did I give the impression it was not edited?  I thought the question was technical in-camera settings (lenses, dof and so on).<br/> <br/>Ursula</td>', 'Originally posted by gutzanu: It''s a miracle :)) It''s remarcable! Did you edit your photo after taking it?   Of course :)))  Did I give the impression it was not edited?  I thought the question was technical in-camera settings (lenses, dof and so on). Ursula', '2004-06-02 17:02:11.000000', NULL, 0),
