(748999, 78420, 5839, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, you realize how far up you are when this city looks small......<br/> <br/>PS I started to write a SimCity reference then saw some one else had already........nice</td>', 'Nice perspective, you realize how far up you are when this city looks small...... PS I started to write a SimCity reference then saw some one else had already........nice', '2004-06-03 16:18:55.000000', NULL, 0),
